edies for digestion.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3><b>Nutritional &amp; Health Benefits<\/b><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Rich in antioxidants and essential oils.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Supports healthy digestion.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Known for anti-inflammatory properties.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">May help in boosting immunity.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Provides natural flavoring without artificial additives.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3><b>Why Choose Bombay Foodstuff Kolinjan?<\/b><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Authentic Thai ginger sourced from premium farms.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Naturally fresh, aromatic, and full of flavor.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Processed and packaged with international quality standards.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Large-scale supply capability for wholesale and export.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Trusted supplier with strong expertise in exotic spices.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bombay Foodstuff offers premium-quality Kolinjan (Thai Ginger), prized in Asian and Thai cuisine for its distinctive lemony-peppery flavor and rich aroma. Unlike common ginger, Kolinjan enhances soups, curries, and pastes with it